  "description": "Internal alterations comprising formation of areas at sub-basement level in Zones E and E2 for installation of goods lifts and Zones E and Y for installation of services corridor; Lowering of lower ground floor slab in Zones E, E2 and Y and sub-basement floor slab in Zone Y. Formation of escalator and lift pits. External alterations to Hans Road ground floor elevation including reinstatement and restoration of historic features to Door 9 at Zone E2 including curved glass windows, high level clerestory windows and decorative tracery, period entrance doors, decorative mosaic floor and addition of new awnings; Replacement fire escape timber doors at relocated Door 9a and new Door 10a with decorative tracery above; Removal of Door 10 and replacement vitrine windows with addition of new awnings; Refurbishment of Hans Mansions door with regrading of pavement for level access; Lowering of cills by one bay and replacement windows at Zones Y and Zone Z; Removal of plant at lower ground level at Zone Y; Removal of railings at Zone Z and extension of pavement to meet the building; Replacement Door 1 at Zone Z to match existing with extended steps and new handrails; Removal of entrance and windows at base of Coronation Tower and replacement with new vitrine displays and stone plinth to match existing; Replacement doors and metal panels to Hans Road Hoist Door at Zone S; and New platform lift installed to steps to Door 2 at Zone S.",
